<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-KIPKETER WINS WORLD MEN'S 800 METRES TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-KIPKETER WINS WORLD MEN'S 800 METRES TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dane Wilson Kipketer won the world men's 800 metres gold medal on Friday.</p>
<p>Norberto Tellez of Cuba took the silver and American Rich Kenah the bronze.</p>
</text>
